  "schema:datePublished": "2025-12-31",
  "schema:description": "The data bundle contains methods description, seismic velocity measurements, as well as supplementary sample reference images, seismic waveform data, and seismic waveform data plots of Bennu particle OREX-800123-0, which has been cut into a parallel-sided slab. Additionally, the dataset will be used to derive dynamic elastic constants of an angular Bennu particle. The sample measurements went nominally without the slab breaking along known XCT-imaged fractures. The seismic velocities were slightly faster than expected.",
